$\therefore$ f(g(S)) $\neq$ f(S)

g(f(S)) = {x $\in$ R : f(x) $\in$ f(S)}

= {x $\in$ R : $x^{2}$ $\in$ $S^{2}}$

= {x $\in$ R : 0 $\leq$ $x^{2}$ $\leq$ 16}

= {x $\in$ R : –4  $\leq$ x  $\leq$ 4}

